// spec/auth/phone.md, "Story: Verify a phone number safely without magic links or SMS pumping"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Only allowed countries, non-VoIP lines, Turnstile-verified requests, and rate-limited numbers receive a 6-digit autofill code"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Codes expire in 10 minutes, lock after 5 wrong attempts, and verify without leaking secrets"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Story: Onboard once, change phone, sign out everywhere, or delete after cooldown"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Onboarding requires username, 18+ self-attestation, and Terms, and issues 100 pts once per verified phone"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Changing phone requires verifying the old phone or support recovery and an unused new number"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Sign out everywhere bumps `sessionsEpoch`, and self-serve deletion holds the phone hash for 30 days"; spec/auth/phone.md, "Username and password sign-in is admitted solely when `isReviewer` is true (D-29)"; spec/auth/email.md, "Sign out everywhere bumps `sessionsEpoch`, and self-serve deletion holds the email hash for 30 days"
